      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "**Problem:** When `decodepsbt` writes partial signatures to JSON, it scans the keys it has already added for every signature.\nThe parser stores signatures by public key ID, so the same public key cannot appear twice in an input's signature map.\n\n**Fix:** Append the entries directly with `pushKVEnd` to skip the repeated scans.\n",
